  npcName: Barlow
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 3295236706101327806, guid: 0898b920e75e7a54bbb7300854e297d8, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Wheat doesn't hurry. Neither do I. We get along.
  - All this waits on the mill. Grain one side, bread the other, and Wick's gears
    in between.
  - If you're walking her way, tell her the field said hello. The mill. She's a her.
    Ask anyone.
